incorporation_legal_framework.pro_forma_first_board_resolution_en:
RESOLVED that:
(1) the incorporation of the Company under the Companies Law, Cap. 113, be ratified;
(2) the subscribers' share subscription be accepted and the first allotment of ordinary shares be recorded in the Register of Members;
(3) the registered office of the Company be established at the address in the Articles, with authority to execute the lease;
(4) [Director A] and [Director B] be appointed as first Directors, with [Director A] as Managing Director;
(5) [Secretary] be appointed as Company Secretary;
(6) the Directors be authorized to open corporate bank and PayPal accounts, make all statutory filings, and progress the factory licensing applications.
